<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Schůzka zrušena</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f5f9;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:40px 20px;">
  <tr><td align="center">
    <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">

      <tr>
        <td style="background:#0f172a;padding:28px 40px;">
          <p style="margin:0;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#22d3ee;letter-spacing:-0.03em;">{$siteTitle}</p>
          <p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">Informace o schůzce</p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="background:#fef2f2;border-bottom:3px solid #ef4444;padding:20px 40px;">
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#991b1b;">Vaše schůzka byla zrušena</p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:36px 40px;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;color:#334155;">Dobrý den, <strong>{$meeting->name}</strong>,</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;color:#475569;line-height:1.6;">
            s lítostí vás informujeme, že vaše schůzka naplánovaná na
            <strong>
              {if $meeting->preferred_date}{date('j. n. Y', strtotime((string) $meeting->preferred_date))}{else}domluvený termín{/if}
              {if $meeting->preferred_time} v {date('H:i', strtotime((string) $meeting->preferred_time))}{/if}
            </strong>
            musela být zrušena.
          </p>

          {if $meeting->admin_notes}
          <div style="background:#fef2f2;border-left:3px solid #ef4444;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;margin-bottom:24px;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;">Důvod</p>
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#7f1d1d;line-height:1.6;">{$meeting->admin_notes|nl2brEscape|noescape}</p>
          </div>
          {/if}

          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;color:#475569;line-height:1.6;">
            Pokud si přejete naplánovat novou schůzku, klikněte níže nebo nás kontaktujte přímo.
          </p>

          <a href="{$bookingUrl}" style="display:inline-block;background:#6366f1;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:24px;">Rezervovat nový termín</a>

          <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#94a3b8;">
            Nebo napište na <a href="mailto:{$fromEmail}" style="color:#6366f1;text-decoration:none;">{$fromEmail}</a>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="background:#f8fafc;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:20px 40px;">
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8;">S pozdravem, <strong style="color:#475569;">{$siteTitle}</strong></p>
        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
